@startuml cmake-targets
title Viscera CMake targets (foundation)

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "VisceraGame\n(executable)" as Game
component "VisceraEngine\n(static library)\nalias: Viscera::Engine" as Engine
component "VisceraEngineTests" as Tests
component "Viscera::Warnings\n(INTERFACE)" as Warnings

Game --> Engine : PRIVATE link
Tests --> Engine : PRIVATE link
Game ..> Warnings : PRIVATE link
Engine ..> Warnings : PRIVATE link
Tests ..> Warnings : PRIVATE link

note right of Engine
  Public headers: engine/include/viscera/
  Generated: Version.hpp (FILE_SET)
end note

note bottom of Warnings
  clang-tidy and cppcheck are configure-time
  tools (CMAKE_CXX_CLANG_TIDY / CMAKE_CXX_CPPCHECK),
  not link targets.
  VisceraCppcheck exists only when
  VISCERA_CPPCHECK is ON.
end note

@enduml
